title: "Antibiotic Time-out"
abstract: "ICU antimicrobial stewardship app that tracks each antibiotic course from its start, flags the 72-hour time-out review (24 hours for prophylaxis), records decisions, culture results and antibiotic switches, and exports a PDF audit report."
